infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Copy-pasted TestXxx functions vs one table
  desc Same rounding contract — the incident diff deleted 340 lines and added 60
  compares
    - label Copy-pasted TestXxx functions
      children
        - label 340 lines of test code
          desc 19 separate functions, each with its own setup and message
        - label ~15 lines to add a case
          desc A new function plus a name — so edge cases get skipped
        - label Coverage you grep for
          desc Which rows actually run is something you search, not read
        - label Missing case stays invisible
          desc The one uncovered row hid for two years
    - label One table test
      children
        - label 60 lines of test code
          desc One slice of anonymous structs, one t.Run loop
        - label 1 line to add a case
          desc Marginal cost near zero — row 24 became the regression test
        - label Coverage you read
          desc 23 rows of name/input/want fit on one screen
        - label Gap visible in minutes
          desc The missing negative-amount row was spotted at once
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
